{
  "_why": "Owner 2026-11-01: hard rules for every session in every permission mode (deny wins even over bypassPermissions). A session may not edit its own permissions (auto-mode classifier: self-modification), so the owner merges this block into .claude/settings.json: python3 tools/dev/apply_permissions.py – or by hand. Allow = fewer prompts for the project's own scripts and read-only git/gh.",
